  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "三种实现路数",
      "items": [
        "直连原生插件：raknet、streamer、colandreas、cef、ompp、fcnpc 等把 samp.callNative 包成有类型函数",
        "挂钩 core 类：nex-ac、weapon-config、veh-para、distance 用 defineHooks 或覆盖 __inject__ 改写实体行为",
        "纯 TypeScript：mapandreas 读高度图、rec 读写位域、query 走 UDP、e-selection 用 TextDraw 拼界面"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "core 提供的接入面",
      "items": [
        "defineEvent 建事件，监听器按注册顺序组成中间件链，用 next() 传递",
        "defineHooks(Class) 返回 [原始方法快照, setHook]，把原型方法换成拦截器",
        "GameMode.use(script) 只入队，装载发生在 onInit；IFilterScript.load() 需返回注销函数数组"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "构建与运行时边界",
      "items": [
        "tsx scripts/build-all.ts 串行：streamer → core → raknet → 其余；每包先 type-check 再 rolldown",
        "samp-node 由 open.mp 加载、跑在 Node 22 上，向脚本注入全局 samp",
        "streamer 与 types 不发布；shared 无 package.json，仅构建期被五个包引用"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
